      "comment": "MARINA BAY (1) was below best at his last start when 8th at Q Lakeside following a second place finish (16.65) at this track two back. Form here at this distance is sound. Form from his last run is proving strong. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. ACES ROSE (2) turned in a solid run last start over 300m at Casino finishing 4th and beaten only 3.5 lengths (17.34). Better than last start and can bounce back. GOLDSTAR JOBLIN (8) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fifth wasn't far away finishing 5 lengths from the winner (19.31). Has a good winning strike rate at this journey. Cannot be underestimated. AU FAIT (7) is one to consider despite coming off a brief layoff.",
